# SEND-SITE-ARTIFICIAL-CAPS (Codex, 2026-09-30): seventy send sites at the root, sixty-nine letters of
# seventeen fields and the exit -- past the 64 sites and the 16 fields of a site the translator held, and past
# its 1024 field places (1176 fields).  Each letter says its site in every field: k, a * k, the text "sk", then
# k * 100 + 4 ... k * 100 + 17.  The driver's `postlog 1` says each post before its delivery, in order.
